Package: TRSC
Type: Package
Title: Temporally Regularized Synthetic Controls
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Onur", "Düzgün",
           email = "77804721+oduzgun@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Research software for temporally regularized synthetic-control
    predictive relationships. The package treats predictive profiles as the
    primary fitted object and allows singular predictive geometry and
    nonunique donor-coordinate representations. Provides chronological
    calibration, fitting and frozen validation, evaluation fibers, dynamic
    continuation sets, auxiliary refinements and outer confidence regions
    under explicitly supplied causal and statistical certificates. Conic
    support optimization retains certified numerical upper enclosures
    separately from approximate primal optimizer values. Includes assumption
    provenance and conditional-mean effect translations.
